{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zepp札幌、おーわりました( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に...今までに経験した事がないほど燃え尽きた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力の中の全力出しすぎて、本当に終わった後の脱力感はんぱじゃなかった。です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今回の特別企画でもあるコント。私は札幌の夜に発表でした、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒とまいまいとひなちまと私！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本番直前までずっと楽屋で「ワオッ  でたぁ！！」しか練習してなかった。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際に会場で観た皆様、いかがでしたか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よければ感想を聞かせてくださいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日からZepp福岡の本番。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"札幌の時の反省点をいかせるように皆さん頑張りましょう。はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きの飛行機は七瀬と隣！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/21/9047339/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中までアホなこと喋ってたけど知らない間に爆睡してた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてホテルではまいやんのお誕生日を祝いにまいやんの部屋へ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ティラミスをみんなお顔につけつつも食べつつもで楽しかったっす！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/21/image.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなぜか関係ないわたしが一番ティラミスまみれにさせられましたとさ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後はみんなでおいしくいただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん！真夏！お誕生日おめでとうね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏はこれからもみんなに愛されそしていじられてくれ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さ！て！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!観てくれましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、本当に、あの豆飛ばし、こわかったです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/21/9047339/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もNOGIBINGO収録がありましたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでさ、何より、今日がなんの日か皆さん覚えてる？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そぉ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46  2周年記念なのよ！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう本当におめでとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録終わった後にはケーキをいただきました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/21/9047339/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもみんなよろしくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き。"}],"source":"archive"}